              <field>
                <name>TI4SEL</name>
                <description>Selects tim_ti4[15:0] input
...
Refer to Section 65.4.2: TIM2/TIM3/TIM4/TIM5 pins and internal signals for product specific implementation.</description>
                <bitOffset>24</bitOffset>
